  {
   "id": "root",
   "x": 293,
   "y": 10,
   "w": 760,
   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "Stressed or anxious patient: an EXPECTED response, or a DISORDER? Are substances involved?",
   "lines": [
    "a mental health screen at EVERY visit, in the review of systems: mood, anxiety, sleep, appetite, concentration, substances, stressors",
    "SAFETY FIRST: ask about thoughts of self-harm or of harming others",
    "they rarely say \"I'm anxious\": they say \"I can't sleep and I have a constant headache\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_d",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 174,
   "w": 732,
   "h": 60,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "A DISORDER? DURATION + INTERFERENCE decide",
   "lines": [
    "symptoms come in CLUSTERS: the same one (insomnia) can belong to either"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_s",
   "x": 817,
   "y": 174,
   "w": 484,
   "h": 60,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "SUBSTANCES: ask every visit",
   "lines": [
    "\"How much alcohol in an average week? Are you or others concerned?\""
   ]
  },
  {
